title: Acoustic Song in C
key: C
tempo: 96
style: acoustic

// An intro and a first verse for the guitar alone, a chorus that opens on the
// four, a bridge on the minor six that turns round on the five, and an outro
// that comes home.
[Intro]
| C | G | Am | F |

[Verse]
| C | G | Am  | F |
| C | G | F G | C |

[Chorus]
| F | G | C | Am |
| F | G | C | %  |

[Verse]

[Chorus]

[Bridge]
| Am | Em | F | C  |
| Dm | F  | G | G7 |

[Chorus]

[Outro]
| F | G | C | % |

